OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns at planned sale of fire
OL,4,Aservice's HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised about plans
OL,7,Fto sell a fire service's headquarters
OL,8,Fand the possibility of outsourcing its
OL,9,Ffirefighters' training and development.
OL,11,FNewcastle-under-Lyme MP Adam Jogee has
OL,12,Fwritten to Staffordshire's Police,
OL,13,FCrime and Fire Commissioner Ben Adams
OL,14,Fabout the future of its Pirehill site
OL,15,Fnear Stone.
OL,17,FAdams told BBC Radio Stoke he was in
OL,18,Fthe early stages of drawing up options
OL,19,Ffor Staffordshire Fire and Rescue
OL,20,FService, and some of the ideas being
OL,21,Fdiscussed might not end up being acted
OL,22,Fupon.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
