OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns at planned sale of fire
OL,4,Aservice's HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe wanted to establish a secure future
OL,7,Ffor the service, he said, in
OL,8,Fpreparation for when his role is
OL,9,Fabolished as part of local government
OL,10,Freorganisation.
